Package: dicomtk.ai
Title: AI Agents, MCP Tooling, and Clinical NLP for 'DICOM' Imaging
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yee How", "Lau", email = "lauyeehow1986@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")))
Description: Satellite Artificial Intelligence ('AI') and clinical natural
    language processing toolkit for 'dicomtk'. Provides 'ellmer'-based clinical
    imaging agents with unbypassable monotonic de-identification guardrails, a
    Model Context Protocol ('MCP') server via 'mcptools', a pluggable REST and
    offline backend registry for segmentation models ('TotalSegmentator' by
    Wasserthal et al. (2023) <doi:10.1148/ryai.230024>, 'nnU-Net', 'VISTA3D',
    and 'MedSAM2' by Ma et al. (2024) <doi:10.1038/s41467-024-44824-z>),
    Integrating the Healthcare Enterprise AI Results ('IHE AIR') standardized
    'DICOM SEG' and 'TID 1500' outputs, radiology report de-identification and
    weak-label extraction, 'RadLex' and 'LOINC-RSNA' protocol harmonisation,
    and 'DuckDB' vector similarity search.
